{"availability":"available","full":"ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI","name":"RTXUI","description":"C++ reactive terminal user interfaces built from HTML templates, CSS, and plain C++ state.","category":"Design","language":"C++","stars":12,"forks":1,"created":"2024-06-14T21:09:16Z","updated":"2026-10-11T06:26:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/","topics":["cpp23","css","html","reactive","terminal","terminal-ui","tui","webassembly"],"demo":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/#interactive-playground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","stars":12,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RTXUI brings the browser's declarative rendering pipeline to modern C++.","Structure interfaces with semantic HTML. Style them with real CSS (flexbox, grid, cascade, and transitions). Bind plain C++ state; mutate a variable and the engine diffs the DOM and repaints the terminal."],"features":["HTML & CSS in C++: Semantic HTML tags styled with standard CSS. Full support for flexbox, grid, cascade specificity, pseudo-classes (:hover, :focus, :active), and transitions.","Reactive State Binding: Bind C++ member variables and callbacks directly to template tokens ({count}, onclick=\"Increment\"). Mutating state triggers surgical DOM diffing and repaints.","🔥 Live Template Hot Reloading: Call EnableHotReload(). Edit your HTML/CSS templates in your editor and watch the running terminal UI update in <10ms without recompiling or restarting.","WebAssembly Ready: Compile the exact same codebase to WebAssembly with Emscripten to run full-speed in modern web browsers.","Spatial Navigation & Focus: Built-in sequential Tab cycling, dynamic Arrow-key spatial navigation, and mouse event routing."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.429Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.429Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RTXUI brings the browser's declarative rendering pipeline to modern C++.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.430Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T06:26:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.430Z","hash":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","originalBytes":6736,"storedBytes":6736,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["rtxui","build","cmake","app","bash","c++","css","html","ninja","count","run","bind","example","flexbox","ftxui","gcc","increment","install","license","standard","state","tests","border","border-color","button","c++23","cascade","compile","contributing","cxx","fetchcontent","focus","grid","hover","interfaces","live","modern","reactive","sudo","terminal","want","add","both","brew","choose","clang","color","compiler","counterapp","declarative","demo","dependencies","directly","dom","drtxui","enablehotreload","engine","functional","git","green","homebrew","hot","include","int","layouts","libraries","link","linux","macos","main","main.cpp","mit","navigation","ninja-build","padding","public","release","reloading","rendering","required","requires","runtime","same","screen","semantic","set","spatial","style","support","tag","template","templates","transitions","under","view","web","webassembly","when","without","active","against","ansi","any","api","apple","apt","arch","architectural","arrow-key","author.","auto","